<title>UK: Rabobank adds $150 mln to March 2001 bond.</title>
<headline>Rabobank adds $150 mln to March 2001 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to $500 million from $350 million, joint lead managers Rabobank and UBS said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RABOBANK NEDERLAND BA</p>
<p> AMT   *$500 MLN	COUPON     6.0	 MATURITY    12.MAR.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.545   PAY DATE  **10.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    99.12     SPREAD	FLAT</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/NL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    N/LANDS   HOME CTRY  N/LANDS   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.20	SELL CONC  1.425     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	*TOTAL SIZE $500 MLN, ORIGINAL LAUNCH 11.FEB.97</p>
<p>	    **+118 DAYS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
</text>
